{"articleNo":"2656","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2656&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 사회봉사활동 실적 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.18","hit":"13740","attachments":[{"name":"사회봉사활동확인서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2656&attachNo=2560"},{"name":"사회봉사과목운영지침.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2656&attachNo=2599"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010학년도 2학기 사회봉사활동확인서 제출 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">2010학년도 2학기 사회봉사활동 확인서 제출에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내 하오니, 해당 학생은 지정 기간 내에 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 제출대상자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2010학년도 2학기에 사회봉사과목을 수강신청 한 학생 중 실제로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 사회봉사활동을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 수행한 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 117.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -117.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 사회봉사기간</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2010. 5. 25(화)&nbsp; ～ 2010. 11. 29(월)까지 수행한 봉사활동</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 제출기간</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 2010. 11. 25(목) ～ 11. 30(화)까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 94.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -94.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">☞</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">학적부에 사진(학사서비스센터 ☎478-7066)이 없거나 학적부기재 사항</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">(영문명,</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">한자명, 주소, E-mail, 연락처)이 정확하지 않은 경우 사회봉사활동 확인서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> 불가능하니 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">사회봉사활동 인정 기관 및 그 외 문의사항은 해당 종합학사행정실로</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 제출장소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">해당 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 사회봉사 학점 인정 이수시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 30시간 이상 이수 시 1학점 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 사회봉사활동의 범위와 대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관 등에서 실시한 봉사활동</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 국</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관에 등록된 사회복지기관 및 시설에서 실시한 봉사활동</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 농어촌 봉사, 환경정화, 자연보호, 의료봉사 활동</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 기타 학부장이 인정하는 봉사활동</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">사회</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">봉사활동 확인서가 필요한 학생은 우리학교 홈페이지 - 교육․학사 자료실에서 다운로드</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 사용 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">8. 문의전화</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 300%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"